+## Usage reported to afterModelResponse
+
+- For a turn that makes no tool calls, `afterModelResponse` receives the single provider call's usage unchanged ([validated by: receives collected response text and usage](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L236)).
+- For a turn that runs tool rounds, `afterModelResponse` receives usage covering every provider call in that turn rather than only the last round's ([validated by: reports the sum of three provider calls when a turn runs two tool rounds](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L59)).
+- When some rounds in a turn report no usage, the rounds that reported are still counted without producing `undefined` or `NaN`, and a turn in which no round reported usage still passes `undefined` ([validated by: counts the rounds that reported usage when one round reports none, and reports nothing when no round did](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.acceptance.test.ts#L90)).
